
# Lab 02 — Active Directory Administration

## Objective
Verify domain user accounts, account status, and group membership.

## Environment
- Windows 11 Pro domain-joined workstation
- Ubuntu Server Active Directory Domain Controller
- Domain: butlerlab.local
- Tools: samba-tool

## Procedures
1. Listed domain user accounts.
2. Confirmed Administrator and labuser accounts existed.
3. Inspected the labuser account.
4. Verified the account was enabled.
5. Checked membership in the Domain Users group.

## Findings
- Administrator account: Present.
- labuser account: Present and enabled.
- labuser membership: Domain Users.

## Skills Practiced
- Active Directory user administration.
- Domain account verification.
- Group membership management.
- Samba AD command-line administration.

## Result
Successfully verified domain users, account status, and group membership.
